# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ZEBROLD GROUP — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION (zebrold.de)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Note: The application and Admin Mail Center work OUT-OF-THE-BOX 
# with zero config via the built-in HTML generators, real-time 
# simulator, FormSubmit gateway fallback, and local audit logging.
#
# If you want to connect your own EmailJS account for direct SMTP/API 
# live inbox delivery, copy this file to `.env` and fill in your keys:
#
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. connected to your @zebrold.de domain or SMTP)
# 3. Create Email Templates with variables: {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, 
#    {{to_name}}, {{to_email}}, {{subject}}, {{email_html}}, {{message}}
# 4. Copy your Public Key from Account Settings > API Keys
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_zebrold
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_CONTACT=template_contact_inquiry
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_CAREER=template_career_application
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_emailjs_public_key_here

